OL,3,GNEWSAMotherland star brands school
OL,4,Afines 'cruel'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe star of Motherland has called
OL,7,Fschool absence fines "cruel and
OL,8,Funnecessary" as she joined campaigners
OL,9,Fhanding in a petition at Downing
OL,10,FStreet.
OL,12,FThe petition, with more than 290,000
OL,13,Fsignatures, has called for families of
OL,14,Fchildren with suspected special
OL,15,Feducational needs and disabilities
OL,16,F(SEND) not to be fined and prosecuted
OL,17,Fwhen pupils do not attend school.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
