OL,3,GNEWSAMotherland star brands school
OL,4,Afines 'cruel'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe campaign was started in 2022 by
OL,7,FSusan Liverman, from Corby,
OL,8,FNorthamptonshire, and Maddie Roberts,
OL,9,Ffrom Sandy, Bedfordshire and has the
OL,10,Fsupport of actor Anna Maxwell Martin
OL,11,Fwho lives in Northamptonshire.
OL,13,FA Department for Education spokesperson
OL,14,Fsaid it was "taking action to transform
OL,15,Fthe system".
